      "text": "Day 5 · Transfer to Manaus airport for your flight to Rio de Janeiro, where your driver meets you for the transfer to the hotel. Rio is green hills, blue sky, beautiful bays, islands and marvellous beaches: Brazil’s second-largest city and one of the most beautiful in the world, where Copacabana, Ipanema and Leblon are famous for their black-and-white mosaic promenades, beach cafés serve coconut water and fresh juices, and local musicians play on the sand.",
